{"id": 41910, "slug": "overdose", "name": "OverDose", "name_original": "OverDose", "description": "<h3>A first-person horror game set in a dark asylum where danger lurks around every corner.</h3><p>The doctor turned his patients into test subjects for ruthless experiments.  </p><p>But one escaped. Hiding in the dark, hunting for revenge.  </p><p>And she is here too… The ghost of the woman who died in the experiments.  </p><p>Her screams still echo, her rage never fades.</p><h3>Do your job, or die</h3><p>Deliver experimental drugs, monitor patients, and prevent escapes. Overdosing means death.  </p><h3>The killer is hunting you</h3><p>Run, lock doors, hide. But you can’t hide forever.  </p><h3>Send the recordings</h3><p>An unknown force demands the camera footage. If you refuse, you might be next.  </p><h3>Terror and desperation</h3><p>The patients rely on you. The doctor watches you. The killer hunts you. Can you survive until dawn?</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-04-04", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-04-07T09:21:35", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/ed7/ed7a64e3a1ff79b500d7023b0f6f412b.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/32a/32a8982ab6123a09d140b71edb604f13.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 4, "added_by_status": {"owned": 1, "toplay": 3}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 20, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 540, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "reviews_count": 0, "community_rating": 0, "saturated_color": "0f0f0f", "dominant_color